WEBVTT

00:05.790 --> 00:07.650
Wow!

00:07.650 --> 00:10.160
I've never seen it from so close before!

00:10.470 --> 00:13.360
It's overflowing with vitality.

00:13.690 --> 00:16.310
Do you have to make that face 
when you look at it, Sensei?

00:16.580 --> 00:19.550
This is the largest tree 
in all of Zauberberg,

00:19.550 --> 00:22.030
Grün's famous World Tree!

00:22.310 --> 00:25.510
No matter how many times I visit, 
it always cleanses the spirit.

00:25.510 --> 00:28.260
I know, right?

00:28.260 --> 00:31.200
We're not impressed by you, Tama.

00:31.200 --> 00:32.720
Wanna say that again, Nir?!

00:33.300 --> 00:37.920
This World Tree is said to be a holy 
tree that watches over Zauberberg.

00:37.920 --> 00:41.830
It grants its protection to 
everyone who visits it.

00:42.400 --> 00:44.850
Hey, let me do the explaining...

00:44.850 --> 00:48.470
At its foot is the quiet town of Toneriko,

00:47.510 --> 00:51.380
Hey. Hey. Hey.

00:48.470 --> 00:52.450
where the people live simple 
lives alongside nature.

00:52.450 --> 00:56.310
Shall we stop by to pray 
for safe travels, as well?

00:58.650 --> 01:02.340
Now, now. Hurry up and drag my coffin.

01:02.950 --> 01:05.960
<b>[ No Longer Allowed               in Another World ]</b>

01:10.920 --> 01:12.840
<b>m 0 0 l 250 0 250 38 0 38</b>

01:10.920 --> 01:12.840
<b>Welcome to Toneriko, the town that loves 
the World Tree and Nature.</b>

01:18.950 --> 01:21.710
That's the Other Worlders' 
language. What does it say?

01:23.710 --> 01:26.140
Damn it! I lost all my money!

01:27.690 --> 01:30.030
It looks like a gambling hall.

01:30.030 --> 01:35.050
In a quiet town where people live 
simple lives alongside nature, huh?

01:37.910 --> 01:39.270
He freaking stabbed him!

01:39.270 --> 01:40.750
That's it! Stab him more!

01:40.750 --> 01:42.240
There must be some mistake.

01:42.510 --> 01:45.320
Water conforms to the shape of the vessel.

01:45.320 --> 01:49.300
This must be the reality 
this town has chosen.

01:53.340 --> 01:55.590
<b>For Commercial Use
Calmotin    Sedative</b>

01:55.930 --> 02:01.480
By the way, are there any trees suitable 
for hanging oneself around here?

02:01.480 --> 02:03.610
Huh? What's gotten into you?

02:03.610 --> 02:06.830
For now, let's go talk to the mayor.

02:08.020 --> 02:10.490
Come on. Let's go, Sensei.

02:10.490 --> 02:13.650
Don't eat pebbles off the ground.

02:14.980 --> 02:18.100
Mr. Mayor, what's going on here?

02:18.490 --> 02:20.890
What happened to the town?

02:22.750 --> 02:24.810
As you know,

02:24.810 --> 02:29.600
Toneriko was a quiet town that lived 
with the blessings of the World Tree.

02:30.080 --> 02:32.030
However, several months ago,

02:32.030 --> 02:36.900
some Other Worlders who came to see 
the World Tree began living here.

02:36.900 --> 02:39.890
Since they built that gambling hall,

02:39.890 --> 02:44.610
it has attracted all kinds of barbarous 
Other Worlders from all over the place,

02:44.610 --> 02:49.770
and they've taken our quiet lifestyle from us.

02:49.770 --> 02:51.820
How deeply sinful.

02:51.820 --> 02:53.700
Take a look.

02:53.700 --> 02:56.400
That's a leaf of the World Tree.

02:56.400 --> 02:58.480
It seems lifeless.

02:58.790 --> 03:04.320
Since then, the World Tree has grown weaker 
every day, and it has begun to wilt.

03:04.320 --> 03:09.240
It must be a sign that the spirit of 
the World Tree is saddened by this.

03:09.500 --> 03:10.690
No...

03:10.690 --> 03:15.160
Travelers, we are running out of time.

03:15.160 --> 03:19.200
Will you restore our town 
to its original state?

03:19.420 --> 03:22.130
<b>Accept the 
mayor's quest? 

Yes

No</b>

03:20.470 --> 03:25.770
More importantly, will you restore 
this jar to its original form?

03:22.140 --> 03:25.730
<b>Yes

No

More importantly,
will you restore this
jar to its original 
form?</b>

03:22.510 --> 03:25.770
<b>For Commercial Use
Calmotin    Sedative</b>

03:25.770 --> 03:26.850
Huh?!

03:26.850 --> 03:29.780
What are you saying, Sensei?

03:29.780 --> 03:31.570
I overheard your conversation.

03:33.880 --> 03:39.730
If the World Tree is in danger, I will save it.

03:39.730 --> 03:41.810
Er... Who are you?

03:41.810 --> 03:44.660
Pardon me. I am Yamada the Other Worlder.

03:44.660 --> 03:46.460
Y-You're an Other Worlder?!

03:47.470 --> 03:54.790
I understand your distrust for 
Other Worlders, but I am different.

03:55.380 --> 03:58.870
I am someone who truly desires 
peace for this world.

03:58.870 --> 04:03.380
As a fellow Other Worlder, 
I cannot ignore their wrongdoings.

04:04.710 --> 04:09.420
Sir, please allow me to handle this.

04:10.220 --> 04:11.880
You mean you'll do it?

04:11.880 --> 04:14.830
Huh. I never knew some of them were like this.

04:14.830 --> 04:16.950
That's a marvelous thought.

04:16.950 --> 04:21.600
Let us assist Mr. Yamada and save 
the town together, Sensei.

04:22.900 --> 04:24.280
Sensei?

04:29.730 --> 04:31.320
My steps are light.

04:31.800 --> 04:33.340
My breaths are deep.

04:33.820 --> 04:36.280
My back is straight.

04:36.760 --> 04:40.220
My mind and body are healthy.

04:40.820 --> 04:43.270
I must do something about this quickly.

04:51.550 --> 04:55.470
This hole stinks of immorality.

05:08.470 --> 05:12.460
What an unhealthy and corrupt place.

05:13.060 --> 05:15.950
This is exactly what I was looking for.

05:15.950 --> 05:20.670
Friends, would you share 
some of your smoke with me?

05:20.920 --> 05:22.310
Please.

05:26.140 --> 05:27.480
And who is this?

05:28.670 --> 05:30.290
I don't recognize you.

05:32.050 --> 05:36.860
Let me take you someplace 
more fun than this.

05:44.570 --> 05:47.950
Hey, uh... Don't you think you've had too much?

05:49.010 --> 05:51.270
I'm trying to drink myself to death.

05:51.270 --> 05:54.410
Living makes me so sad I can't bear it.

05:55.370 --> 05:56.950
What an interesting person.

05:58.050 --> 06:00.990
But what were you doing in that cave?

06:02.080 --> 06:08.210
That's where people who are addicted to 
the World Tree's pain-relieving leaves go.

06:08.590 --> 06:11.430
I lost something important to me.

06:11.950 --> 06:18.640
The thought of my mind and body becoming 
healthy keeps me up at night.

06:21.290 --> 06:23.120
What's your name?

06:23.860 --> 06:26.580
People call me Sensei.

06:26.950 --> 06:28.530
In that case, Sensei...

06:29.530 --> 06:32.940
I'll help you sleep comfortably.

06:35.090 --> 06:37.750
Despite how I seem, I'm a dancer.

06:38.820 --> 06:41.580
Take my word for it and watch.

06:42.050 --> 06:44.760
A dancer...

06:43.210 --> 06:45.420
<b>The Dancing Girl of Izu
 by Yasunari Kawabata</b>

06:46.230 --> 06:49.610
Is watching someone dance so great?

06:49.610 --> 06:50.880
Just watch.

07:17.450 --> 07:18.870
I see.

07:19.910 --> 07:23.920
What a pleasant night.

07:30.540 --> 07:33.070
Sensei...

07:33.070 --> 07:37.100
Where did you go?

07:37.100 --> 07:38.440
Calm down.

07:38.440 --> 07:40.250
Is something wrong with her?

07:40.840 --> 07:43.480
Our friend has been missing since yesterday.

07:44.430 --> 07:46.000
Sensei!

07:51.000 --> 07:53.680
We're here, Sensei.

07:53.680 --> 07:55.670
Who are you?!

07:55.950 --> 07:58.030
Now, now...

07:57.400 --> 07:59.110
What do you want, Esche?

07:59.570 --> 08:02.130
I thought I told you not to come here.

08:02.420 --> 08:06.940
I only came to drop this man off.

08:12.120 --> 08:15.400
See you later, Sensei. Sweet dreams.

08:16.630 --> 08:19.700
Another person ruined...

08:19.700 --> 08:21.460
Who was that?

08:21.890 --> 08:24.120
Her name is Esche.

08:24.400 --> 08:27.470
They call her the Witch of Toneriko.

08:27.470 --> 08:29.160
A w-witch?

08:29.160 --> 08:31.010
Sounds ominous.

08:31.010 --> 08:32.070
Yes.

08:32.300 --> 08:38.980
When the fallen Other Worlders began 
building the gambling hall on the edge of town,

08:38.980 --> 08:42.330
we were powerless to stop them.

08:42.830 --> 08:45.800
But Esche was different.

08:46.100 --> 08:48.770
Only she gained the favor 
of the fallen Other Worlders

08:48.770 --> 08:53.050
and opened a bar next to the gambling hall.

08:53.750 --> 08:57.390
So she's a resident who sided 
with the fallen Other Worlders.

08:57.640 --> 09:02.470
She was always a mysterious woman 
who lived on the edge of town.

09:02.780 --> 09:05.040
Her age and history are unknown.

09:05.040 --> 09:09.680
We left her alone because she was harmless, 
but she's a real trickster.

09:09.970 --> 09:16.690
Now she makes a fortune charming fallen 
Other Worlders with her liquor and dancing.

09:17.070 --> 09:23.410
At some point, the townsfolk began 
calling her the Traitorous Witch.

09:23.410 --> 09:27.100
So she sided with evil to make money.

09:27.100 --> 09:32.750
Like the fallen Other Worlders, that witch 
will have to face righteous judgment.

09:32.750 --> 09:35.290
Oh, how promising!

09:35.290 --> 09:38.870
You are a true hero.

09:38.870 --> 09:42.430
Please save our town.

09:44.400 --> 09:48.290
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

09:44.910 --> 09:48.290
This Hole
Stinks of
Immorality

09:48.290 --> 09:49.120
This Hole
Stinks of
Immorality

09:48.290 --> 09:49.160
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

09:49.120 --> 09:49.160
This Hole
Stinks of
Immorality

09:49.160 --> 09:49.200
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

09:49.160 --> 09:49.200
This Hole
Stinks of
Immorality

09:49.210 --> 09:49.250
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

09:49.250 --> 09:49.330
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

09:49.330 --> 09:49.370
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

09:51.770 --> 09:53.740
Wait, Sensei!

09:53.740 --> 09:55.340
Where are you going?

09:55.340 --> 09:58.690
The battle against the Other 
Worlders is starting soon.

09:58.690 --> 10:02.660
I don't recall accepting such a dangerous job.

10:03.050 --> 10:07.380
What I need now is the peace 
granted by that bar.

10:07.380 --> 10:08.490
Sensei!

10:08.490 --> 10:09.400
Don't waste your time.

10:09.850 --> 10:13.080
He's already been charmed by the witch.

10:13.080 --> 10:14.350
But...

10:14.900 --> 10:16.300
Don't worry.

10:16.750 --> 10:21.760
If we destroy the evil dwelling in this 
town, I'm sure he will come to his senses.

10:23.310 --> 10:25.440
Thank you, Esche-kun.

10:25.440 --> 10:31.740
Because of you, I forgot about my 
painful life last night and dreamed.

10:31.740 --> 10:33.920
Oh, Sensei.

10:34.670 --> 10:37.950
Even so, you shouldn't hang around here.

10:38.500 --> 10:41.900
Don't you know they call me a witch?

10:42.510 --> 10:45.900
Don't blame me if I ruin you.

10:46.380 --> 10:49.620
That's exactly what I want.

10:49.620 --> 10:51.590
My word. You're unbelievable.

10:52.530 --> 10:58.960
Then may the spirit of the World Tree grant 
its protection to your painful life.

11:02.000 --> 11:03.810
The spirit of the World Tree?

11:03.810 --> 11:07.150
Don't you know? That's the legend around here.

11:07.920 --> 11:10.700
"When the spirit of the World Tree descends,

11:10.700 --> 11:15.610
the wishes of the weak and sick will 
be granted, and they will be saved."

11:16.260 --> 11:18.930
Why don't you try praying 
to the World Tree, too?

11:20.390 --> 11:24.780
It may ease your pain a little.

11:28.410 --> 11:33.370
Aren't you the one who wants to be saved?

11:35.750 --> 11:38.540
It occurred to me when I saw you last night.

11:38.850 --> 11:43.520
Your dancing is beautiful, 
delicate, and above all...

11:44.430 --> 11:46.280
filled with sadness.

11:47.340 --> 11:51.930
I... I'm not...

11:52.240 --> 11:54.890
Esche, I need a drink!

11:54.890 --> 11:56.580
Bring me something to drink!

11:56.580 --> 11:57.980
Right away.

11:58.780 --> 12:00.310
Sensei, take your time.

12:01.850 --> 12:03.980
You scumbags.

12:03.980 --> 12:08.480
You blew the money you 
owed us at the casino?

12:08.480 --> 12:10.740
S-Sorry. I promise we'll pay you back.

12:10.740 --> 12:12.800
Your promises don't mean shit!

12:12.800 --> 12:14.370
If you don't pay us back today,

12:14.370 --> 12:19.420
I'll use my overpowered skill Ant Lion 
to bury you in the deserts of Samstag!

12:19.420 --> 12:23.470
Now go sell a kidney or something 
and get me that money!

12:22.880 --> 12:25.920
Y-Yes, sir!

12:25.920 --> 12:28.920
For cryin' out loud... Anyway, boss,

12:28.920 --> 12:34.130
our profits are way down since there 
are fewer idiots like them around.

12:34.130 --> 12:37.630
Should we move the casino elsewhere?

12:37.630 --> 12:40.140
No, it's too soon for that.

12:40.800 --> 12:44.270
We'll draw in the people across the bridge.

12:44.660 --> 12:49.000
We just have to show those carefree 
demis the joy of gambling

12:49.000 --> 12:56.380
and how good it feels to smoke extra-strong 
leaves from the World Tree.

12:57.540 --> 13:02.180
My, my, boss. That doesn't sound very nice.

13:02.790 --> 13:05.610
You promised only Other Worlders 
could play at the casino,

13:05.610 --> 13:08.150
and that you'd leave the townsfolk alone.

13:08.480 --> 13:12.340
Sorry, but this is business, Esche.

13:12.710 --> 13:16.820
Besides, with more customers, 
you'll make more money, too.

13:16.820 --> 13:18.950
I don't care about that.

13:18.950 --> 13:24.810
I paid you a ton in protection money so you 
wouldn't touch the people across the bridge.

13:24.810 --> 13:29.110
Hey, Sabu. Go kidnap a few folks and 
have them smoke some leaf as a test.

13:29.110 --> 13:30.030
Yes, boss.

13:30.030 --> 13:31.250
Please!

13:31.250 --> 13:32.950
Leave the townsfolk alone!

13:32.950 --> 13:34.150
Shut up!

13:39.090 --> 13:41.300
S-Sensei...

13:41.840 --> 13:46.990
In the world I come from, we don't 
call women like you witches.

13:49.190 --> 13:51.170
You are an angel.

13:55.850 --> 13:57.090
What was that?

13:57.820 --> 13:59.940
What was that sound?

14:06.690 --> 14:10.960
Y-You brats! What do you think you're doing?!

14:10.960 --> 14:14.140
There you are, evil fallen Other Worlders...

14:14.140 --> 14:17.840
and the greedy witch who 
chose to work with them.

14:18.090 --> 14:21.730
You've disrupted the quiet lives 
of the innocent townsfolk.

14:22.320 --> 14:24.800
Now face your punishment.

14:24.800 --> 14:27.930
Who do you think you're 
talking to?! Get him!

14:28.270 --> 14:29.420
Good grief.

14:29.420 --> 14:30.150
Huh?

14:30.150 --> 14:32.770
I was having such pleasant dreams, too.

14:33.060 --> 14:34.360
You've ruined it.

14:34.360 --> 14:35.220
Eh?

14:35.490 --> 14:36.740
Sensei?

14:37.580 --> 14:45.100
I can't stand people like 
you who shout grand things.

14:45.750 --> 14:47.230
Sensei...

14:47.600 --> 14:50.480
Sorry, but I don't have time for you.

14:50.480 --> 14:56.210
Unlike you, a disgrace to the rest of 
us Other Worlders, I'm a busy man.

14:56.590 --> 15:01.920
You should come to your senses and 
consider what it is that you should do.

15:02.740 --> 15:04.930
Where do you think you're sitting?!

15:05.200 --> 15:08.660
Thank you for sharing your 
opinion, Yamada-kun.

15:08.660 --> 15:14.770
But I've never once changed my 
ways because someone lectured me.

15:15.230 --> 15:21.720
I've also never once respected 
someone for lecturing me.

15:22.150 --> 15:23.640
Good grief.

15:24.700 --> 15:29.400
Then I shall show you what 
righteous conduct looks like.

15:29.710 --> 15:32.530
Sabu, shut him up.

15:32.530 --> 15:33.400
Yes, boss.

15:34.360 --> 15:37.490
Wrap him up and throw him in the river!

15:37.490 --> 15:38.250
Yes, boss!

15:40.740 --> 15:43.030
Justice Judgment.

15:43.720 --> 15:45.260
Be judged!

15:49.200 --> 15:50.200
Wow.

15:50.200 --> 15:52.290
He's really strong.

15:53.190 --> 15:55.820
B-Boss, this isn't gonna work!

15:55.820 --> 15:57.860
R-Retreat!

15:57.860 --> 16:00.090
You'll pay for this, idiot!

16:01.270 --> 16:04.970
Now, will you turn your blade against me, too?

16:07.060 --> 16:10.580
No. Thank you for saving the town.

16:10.850 --> 16:13.200
So you've finally come to your senses.

16:13.200 --> 16:17.340
If you've learned your lesson, 
I suggest you mend your ways.

16:17.340 --> 16:18.700
Lord Yamada.

16:19.030 --> 16:22.010
As promised, I've reclaimed your town.

16:22.010 --> 16:24.330
Peace has returned to Toneriko!

16:24.330 --> 16:25.990
You are the town's savior!

16:25.990 --> 16:27.250
Thank you, hero!

16:27.250 --> 16:29.060
Please, that's enough.

16:31.000 --> 16:32.050
The witch.

16:32.050 --> 16:33.440
It's Esche the Witch.

16:33.890 --> 16:35.190
The traitor.

16:35.190 --> 16:37.300
Wasn't she working with 
the fallen Other Worlders?

16:38.830 --> 16:41.810
How much did she make off of nightlife?

16:42.760 --> 16:44.760
Now hold on, good people.

16:44.760 --> 16:47.730
She regrets her actions. No further—

16:48.180 --> 16:49.910
Drive off the witch!

16:49.910 --> 16:51.990
You should be ashamed of yourself, traitor!

16:51.990 --> 16:53.960
Leave this town!

16:55.900 --> 16:57.370
Good people...

17:00.050 --> 17:03.940
Good grief. All worlds are the same.

17:04.670 --> 17:08.630
All people are worthless scum.

17:08.630 --> 17:10.470
S-Sensei...

17:11.420 --> 17:12.700
Wh-Who are you?

17:12.990 --> 17:19.220
Is that how you treat the one who fought 
all by herself to protect this town?

17:19.220 --> 17:20.750
What did you say?!

17:20.750 --> 17:22.680
You're siding with the witch?!

17:23.240 --> 17:27.400
Every night, she buttered 
up those thugs at her bar

17:27.860 --> 17:32.810
and kept them in check so no harm 
would come to you townsfolk.

17:33.290 --> 17:40.920
Without her, they would've invaded this 
town long before now and tyrannized you.

17:41.680 --> 17:46.460
If this town has a savior, it's Esche-kun.

17:47.050 --> 17:52.350
It's you who throw rocks at 
her who should be ashamed.

17:52.350 --> 17:55.670
Sh-Shut up! We won't be fooled by your story!

17:55.670 --> 17:58.740
They're the lies of a man 
charmed by the witch!

17:59.140 --> 18:00.150
Sensei...

18:00.770 --> 18:02.120
It's fine.

18:02.120 --> 18:03.330
Esche-kun...

18:04.710 --> 18:05.920
Leave!

18:05.920 --> 18:06.680
Leave this town!

18:06.680 --> 18:08.130
You miser!

18:06.680 --> 18:09.940
Sorry for all the trouble I caused.

18:08.830 --> 18:09.940
Damn witch!

18:09.940 --> 18:11.280
Go on, beat it!

18:15.350 --> 18:18.120
We did it! The evil witch is gone!

18:18.120 --> 18:19.450
True peace has arrived!

18:19.450 --> 18:21.250
Tonight, we celebrate!

18:29.020 --> 18:31.370
Did you know this would happen?

18:36.230 --> 18:40.590
The line between righteousness 
and evil is a hazy thing.

18:41.240 --> 18:48.780
Yet many wish for a clear distinction and 
never doubt that they themselves are good.

18:49.540 --> 18:52.450
When shouted at by such people,

18:52.450 --> 18:58.500
the delicate and beautiful true 
love for another is erased.

18:59.480 --> 19:02.000
A-Are you saying I was wrong?

19:02.000 --> 19:07.690
Who knows? One thing is clear.

19:08.210 --> 19:12.540
This town willingly let 
go of its own protector.

19:14.560 --> 19:15.780
Sensei!

19:15.780 --> 19:18.010
Don't leave us behind!

19:18.010 --> 19:19.240
Sensei!

19:19.240 --> 19:20.680
Wait for us!

19:20.680 --> 19:22.950
Do you have a moment, Lord Yamada?

19:23.690 --> 19:28.340
After seeing your strength, 
I have another request.

19:28.610 --> 19:35.030
Those fallen Other Worlders made a fortune 
selling the leaves of the World Tree.

19:35.030 --> 19:36.480
They were doing that?

19:37.170 --> 19:44.450
So we've decided to continue that 
practice and sell them ourselves.

19:44.450 --> 19:45.290
What?

19:45.650 --> 19:48.250
The evildoers are gone.

19:48.250 --> 19:53.370
The World Tree will be revived and 
grant us even more blessings.

19:54.780 --> 19:56.450
So...

19:57.330 --> 20:01.300
We'd like you to become 
this town's bodyguard.

20:01.710 --> 20:05.100
Should those evil fallen Other Worlders

20:05.100 --> 20:08.510
or the nasty witch return to 
interfere with our business,

20:08.510 --> 20:12.390
we'd like you to carry out 
justice against them again.

20:13.190 --> 20:17.760
As for your payment, how does 
10% of the profits sound?

20:22.180 --> 20:26.860
The line between righteousness 
and evil is a hazy thing.

20:27.920 --> 20:31.630
What have I done?

20:36.040 --> 20:39.260
That ending left me with 
a bad taste in my mouth.

20:39.600 --> 20:42.640
You saw the whole picture, didn't you?

20:42.640 --> 20:44.600
I wouldn't say that.

20:45.020 --> 20:49.310
Despite what I said to Yamada-kun, 
I'm no different.

20:49.970 --> 20:52.980
After all, I failed to save her.

20:53.810 --> 20:55.120
Sensei...

21:04.360 --> 21:06.010
H-Hey...

21:07.200 --> 21:08.590
Look.

21:23.110 --> 21:25.040
The World Tree!

21:25.040 --> 21:27.360
Wha... What...

21:28.400 --> 21:30.950
What?!

21:32.290 --> 21:35.940
It can't be... The World Tree dried up...

21:48.880 --> 21:50.070
Esche-kun...

21:51.510 --> 21:56.970
Thank you for understanding me, Sensei.

21:57.450 --> 22:05.340
May you find some peace in your life.

22:27.200 --> 22:30.400
"When the spirit of the World Tree descends,

22:30.400 --> 22:35.660
the wishes of the weak and sick will 
be granted, and they will be saved."

22:37.590 --> 22:40.430
I see. So you were...

22:53.640 --> 23:01.900
<b>m 0 0 l 226 0 226 24 0 24</b>

22:53.640 --> 23:01.900
<b>Sensei has acquired infinite Calmotin.</b>
